{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":486768,\"title\":\"Maniática: directo a tu conciencia\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nJtstPwc1vXAqWSJALpYz76Wy3K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kT3Yor1uu4q7RaF5Ekm1AzXRNL5.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2016,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"ES\",\"name\":\"Spain\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1922642,\"name\":\"Vicente 'Viri' Ortega\",\"character\":\"Voz\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yJTqDzZgTj5TCUUem63nrY1szyC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1922643,\"name\":\"Javi Chispes\",\"character\":\"Guitarra y voz\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1922645,\"name\":\"Amador 'Ama' Fernández\",\"character\":\"Guitarra\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1922646,\"name\":\"Luis Miguel 'Txispín' Ruiz\",\"character\":\"Bajo y coros\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1925641,\"name\":\"Paco 'Chato' Fernández\",\"character\":\"Batería\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":392820,\"title\":\"Gimme Danger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8YHqUETRBIFza756s8kcuU8XhEQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pZpNErsqNbzODGAudQvhJ7pp6oH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"No other band in rock'n'roll history has rivaled The Stooges' combination of heavy primal throb, spiked psychedelia, blues-a-billy grind, complete with succinct angst-ridden lyrics, and a snarling, preening leopard of a frontman who somehow embodies Nijinsky, Bruce Lee, Harpo Marx, and Arthur Rimbaud all rolled into one. There is no precedent for The Stooges, while those inspired by them are now legion.  This film presents the context of their emergence musically, culturally, politically, historically, and relates their adventures and misadventures while charting their inspirations and the reasons behind their initial commercial challenges, as well as their long-lasting legacy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2188,\"title\":\"The Corrs: Live at Lansdowne Road\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ApXQQS8peDN9wzXhpU30xzFH5TN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vloSviBTcbNM9a7rjmL9saaYMix.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Irish-Celtic-pop siblings, The Corrs, perform songs from their first two albums for 43,000 fans at Lansdowne Road, Dublin's old rugby fields.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69,\"title\":\"Walk the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash's life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5723,\"title\":\"Once\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nW363kSYRCkr4VGOMvuSGwtzKs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1XSyBriqz7oBWoVcRqYlB6Kve3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A vacuum repairman moonlights as a street musician and hopes for his big break. One day a Czech immigrant, who earns a living selling flowers, approaches him with the news that she is also an aspiring singer-songwriter. The pair decide to collaborate, and the songs that they compose reflect the story of their blossoming love.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2179,\"title\":\"Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8baHzEIfrBvBy5b9XKe87Skl1tf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/frWnQLBGB6ROzdK2aPCCLRnz24J.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterner JB bonds with local slacker KG and they form the rock band Tenacious D. Setting out to become the world's greatest band is no easy feat, so they set out to steal what could be the answer to their prayers... a magical guitar pick housed in a rock-and-roll museum some 300 miles away.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":458139,\"title\":\"Slash: Raised On the Sunset Strip\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6pjg3Pp4PZnzCslAZhBgtPsZ05l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bWtYJ1Z8bHmjMt2uezuL8Bj748R.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Directv and Guitar Center documentary highlighting the iconic rock guitarist, Slash. Featuring interviews with Dave Grohl, Joe Perry, Alice Cooper, Duff Mckagan, Nikki Sixx, and many more...\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270016,\"title\":\"Elvis by the Presleys\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rdYML6V994npU7RKcnjijLIJ8Fj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7Cj8MnFVj9ite3NAqBrqFajuy8.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Priscilla Presley, her daughter, their family and their friends open their hearts in the backdrop of Graceland's memories with much modesty and emotion.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2235,\"title\":\"Earth, Wind & Fire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mjOBqlfy9yHUhN0REGk2QU9pWwF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.2,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One of the hottest R&B groups of all time, the legendary Earth, Wind & Fire in concert define excitement. Captured live on their remarkable 1994 sell-out tour of Japan, this performance showcases the band's distinctive style and raw energy and marks Maurice White's last taped appearance with the group in concert.\\r Always dynamite on stage with their unmistakable sound and electrifying showmanship, Earth, Wind & Fire combine all the greatest elements of rock and soul!  1. September\\r 2. Let Your Feelings Show\\r 3. Let's Groove\\r 4. Runnin'\\r 5. Boogie Wonderland\\r 6. Can't Hide Love\\r 7. Fantasy\\r 8. Kalimba Interlude\\r 9. Evil\\r 10. Shining Star\\r 11. Keep Your Head To The Sky\\r 12. Reasons\\r 13. Sing A Song\\r 14. That's The Way Of The World\\r 15. Wouldn't Change A Thing About You\\r 16. After The Love Is Gone\\r 17. System Of Survival\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463747,\"title\":\"Radiohead | NorthSide 2017\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hWB5nlCuyk9POEzI34UeFFUlb1r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4qvabUFnDQfLgHnb1s9DZByYEG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Radiohead performs at Denmark's NorthSide Festival on June 11, 2017.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"O5ROSS9ReUY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dvdeSCCB6QA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ryeagrwvTXQ\",\"name\":\"